{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/11/2026CyJvLOX1uJ1794278733.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>李家鼎（鼎爺）曾示範教煮香噴噴的「韭菜豆腐炆火腩」，做法原來大有講究，要煮得豆腐入味又不散爛、韭菜保持翠綠不出水，究竟有何要訣？</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"5a6967ef-6c40-47b8-b8f3-58a592a9433c.jpg.webp\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/11/202607nGLyKMSI1794278732.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>「韭菜豆腐炆火腩」材料</p><ul><li><p>韭菜</p></li><li><p>硬豆腐</p></li><li><p>火腩</p></li><li><p>蝦醬</p></li><li><p>薑</p></li><li><p>蒜</p></li><li><p>乾蔥</p></li></ul><p>「韭菜豆腐炆火腩」煮食步驟</p><ol><li><p>首先將豆腐切件，吸乾水份。</p></li><li><p>在豆腐面頭灑上少許鹽。</p></li><li><p>再將乾蔥拍扁，韭菜切段，腩肉切件。</p></li><li><p>先燒熱砂煲，下油，下豆腐煎至四面金黃，再盛起。</p></li><li><p>砂煲下油，爆香薑、乾蔥、蒜，下火腩，加蓋焗數分鐘。</p></li><li><p>再下韭菜、蝦醬炒勻，下糖和鹽來調味。</p></li><li><p>再加入豆腐，蓋上焗數分鐘。</p></li></ol><p><p><img alt=\"f2d6152f-c5ce-4e23-823c-a8242c49e9ce.jpg.webp\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/11/2026Z89uWX1itG1794278732.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-10T13:00:47.783271+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":237,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-10T06:43:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-11T10:09:35.634052+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-10T12:54:18.792964+00:00","content_hash":"e6d11ad900ac193a16af946c95a295f21c5cbf186b2868aeadddc8fe657c2635","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-10T13:00:47.783271+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}